[totals 19 languages]
  entries          5712728
  asset.bytes      188844757
  lemma 1563976 · phrase 234051 · form 3883253 · abbr 31448
  packs.attached   19 of 19
  packs.bytes      2653138944  (v5 was 2901291008 — the form dedupe saved 8.6%)
  note             entries and classes are unchanged from v4/v5: the same
                   extracts, the same classifier. What v6 changes is the
                   FORM TABLE, collapsed on (fold, target), and that every
                   pack is now attached rather than twelve being held.
                   **THE JSONL EXPORTS WERE REGENERATED TOO.** export_pack.py
                   reads the form table for its `f` and `t` fields, so a v4
                   export beside a v6 pack would have been two published
                   artifacts that disagree. Every asset.sha256 below is a
                   fresh digest of a fresh export from the v6 pack.
